      "html": "<p>Rivulus hartii (the species has recently been placed in the genus Anablepsoides, thus the correct name is now Anablepsoides hartii) becomes comparatively large and grows to a maximum size of 11 cm. In the aquarium this rather peaceful fish can live up to 3 years.</p>"
